      "text": "left = 3\nright = 4 \nmid = 5\n\nas nums[mid] < nums[right]\nthe ahead array is perfectly sorted\n, \n\nleft  = mid + 1",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
